## Development Workflow

### Phase 1: Abstractions (2 hours)
```bash
cd src/okr_executive/

# Build these files:
# - engines/base.py (ExecutionEngine interface)
# - adapters/event_broker.py (EventBroker interface)
# - adapters/repository.py (Repository interface)

make test-phase-1
```

### Phase 2: Domain Models (2 hours)
```bash
cd src/okr_executive/

# Build these files:
# - domain/models.py (OKRModel, GoalModel, etc.)
# - domain/events.py (All 7 event types)

make test-phase-2
```

### Subsequent Phases
See: `docs/DEVELOPMENT.md`

