## Key Files to Know

| File | Purpose | Size |
|------|---------|------|
| `src/okr_executive/__init__.py` | Package root | 100 lines |
| `src/okr_executive/engines/base.py` | ExecutionEngine interface | 50 lines |
| `src/okr_executive/domain/models.py` | Data models | 200 lines |
| `src/okr_executive/domain/events.py` | Event types | 150 lines |
| `src/okr_executive/orchestrator/okr_orchestrator.py` | Main orchestrator | 300 lines |
| `tests/unit/test_models.py` | Model tests | 150 lines |
| `tests/integration/test_e2e_pipeline.py` | End-to-end tests | 200 lines |

